@startuml Normal Build Flow

title Normal Build Flow

skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam roundcorner 5
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderThickness 1.5
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #E8F4F8
skinparam noteBorderColor #DAA520
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFACD
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderThickness 1
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #999999
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left

actor       "User"               as U
participant "Web Frontend"       as FE
participant "Backend API"        as BE
participant "Automation Worker"  as W
participant "Proxmox Hypervisor" as PX

== Build Submission ==

U  -> FE : Configure scenario\n(template, scripts, parameters)
FE -> BE : POST /api/builds
BE --> FE : 201 Created {requestId, state=QUEUED}
FE --> U  : Redirect to build status page

== Job Claiming ==

W  -> BE : POST /api/worker/jobs/claim
note right : HTTP 204 = queue empty;\nworker sleeps then retries.
BE --> W  : 200 OK — full build spec\n(scripts + resolved parameters,\nbuildSeed, sshAuthMethod)

== VM Provisioning (Stages 2–5) ==

W  -> PX : Clone template VM (full copy)
W  -> BE : PATCH …/progress (stage=CONFIGURE_NETWORK)
W  -> PX : Attach isolated bridge\nInject ephemeral cloud-init SSH key
W  -> PX : Start VM
W  -> PX : Poll guest agent for IP (up to 120s)\nAwait SSH daemon (up to 300s)\nvia Proxmox jump host

== Script Execution & Flag Placement (Stages 6–11) ==

loop Each script (pre-resolved execution order)
  W  -> PX : SSH: prepend param exports\n+ pipe script to bash -s
  W  -> BE : PATCH …/progress (stage=EXECUTE_SCRIPTS i/n)
end

W  -> BE : POST …/derive-flags {timestamp}
BE --> W  : {rawFlags per script, vmLoginPassword}

W  -> PX : SSH: write each flag to declared path\nverify by read-back

W  -> PX : SSH: sanitise VM\n(remove keys, host certs, logs,\nreset credentials, portable netplan)
W  -> PX : ACPI shutdown\nRemove network interfaces

== OVA Export (Stages 12–13) ==

W  -> BE : PATCH …/progress (stage=EXPORTING)
note right : Backend detects "EXPORTING" stage\nand transitions state BUILDING→EXPORTING.

W  -> PX : SSH: manual export (qm exportovf removed in PVE 9.x)\nsudo pvesm path → sudo qemu-img convert --salvage -O vmdk\n+ generate OVF 1.0 descriptor → tar to vm.ova
PX --> W  : SFTP: vm.ova → worker export path\n(or direct write when co-located on shared storage)
W  -> W  : Compute SHA-256 of OVA

== Completion (Stages 14–16) ==

W  -> W  : Assemble provenance manifest\n(template hash, script hashes,\nexecution records, flag timestamp)

W  -> BE : POST …/complete\n{ovaPath, ovaChecksum, provenance,\nflagHashes — SHA-256 only, never raw}
note right : Retries up to 3× (5s back-off).

BE -> BE : Re-derive expected flag hashes\nConstant-time comparison
BE --> W  : 200 OK — state transitions to READY

W  -> PX : Delete build VM (cleanup)

== Frontend Status Polling ==

loop Every 2s while QUEUED / BUILDING / EXPORTING
  FE -> BE : GET /api/builds/{id}
  BE --> FE : {state, currentWorkerStage, progressPercent}
  FE --> U  : Update progress bar
end

FE --> U : state=READY\nShow OVA download + flag submission

@enduml
